  "rationale": "The workflow is a workflow_dispatch-only Docker image trigger that delegates all building to external Buildkite pipelines. It contains a single job with no matrix, no dependency installation steps (no cargo build/fetch, no package manager install), no test steps, no scheduled triggers, and no path-filterable push/PR triggers. Evaluated patterns: P-LIT-GHA-CACHE has nothing to cache because the workflow never installs dependencies; P-LIT-FAIL-FAST does not apply to a single non-matrix job; P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT is unnecessary since CI history shows runs complete in about 20 seconds with no evidence of runaway jobs; P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE is contraindicated for deployment-related Docker image work; P-LIT-CHANGE-FILTER and schedule-based patterns do not fit a workflow_dispatch-only workflow. No supported optimization preserves coverage while meaningfully changing this thin trigger wrapper.",
